msgid "This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected for autonomous modes to function. Compass is not required for normal Plane mode operation, but is for typical Copter, QuadPlane, and Rover operation."
msgstr ""

